  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper studies a hybrid quantum-classical A3C trading agent for weekly S&P 500 trading from Jan 2022 to Apr 2024, using an 8-qubit, depth-2 VQC with angle encoding, Ry/Rz rotations, and CNOT entanglers. The best reported result is Quantum A3C with LSTM forecasting, which achieves 30.13% cumulative return, Sharpe ratio 4.01, Calmar ratio 1.68, and max drawdown -3.78%, outperforming the classical A3C baselines in the reported metrics.",
